/**
 * GCC Atlas seed dataset.
 *
 * PROVENANCE POLICY:
 * - Records marked is_demo_data=0 contain genuine public information (company
 *   names, cities, entry years, policies) as widely reported in public sources.
 * - Every source points to a stable, real URL (official company domains,
 *   government portals, Wikipedia, industry bodies). Where an exact article
 *   link is not guaranteed, the publication homepage is used and
 *   verification_status is 'unverified' with an explicit note.
 * - Numeric city metrics are INDICATIVE ESTIMATES (is_estimate=1, low/medium
 *   confidence) with definitions explaining their limits. They must never be
 *   presented as authoritative figures.
 * - No employee counts, salaries, rents or counts are invented without the
 *   estimate flag. "Not available" is preferred over a guessed value.
 */
